<title>FRANCE: Pechiney sees higher H2 oper margin.</title>
<headline>Pechiney sees higher H2 oper margin.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pechiney chairman Jean-Pierre Rodier forecast on Wednesday that the aluminium group's operating margin would be substantially higher in the second half of 1997 than the year-earlier level.</p>
<p>&quot;While remaining prudent, it seems clear to us today that the operating margin in the second half will be very significantly higher than that of the second half of 1996,&quot; he told the annual general meeting.</p>
</text>
